  3. WHAT IS NOT ASSERTED
  This file asserts NO pass and NO failure. It is an inventory of the test methods this class declared at
  the base commit, not a record of an observed outcome:
    the zero values on failures, errors and skipped are SCHEMA REQUIREMENTS of the report form, NOT
